{
  "arguments": {
    "query": "vLLM cache_salt 加到哪个 block 的 hash？跨租户复用有什么条件，V0支持吗？"
  },
  "observation": {
    "evidence": [
      {
        "id": "E505e714382a1cea116ed7ae6",
        "chunk_id": "3078f5394332d8283daa108f",
        "parent_id": "a5b4116ce72ddc4d869dbedf",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L60-L77",
        "content": "```text\nBlock 0\n    Parent hash: None\n    Token IDs: 1, 3, 7493, 1681, 1294, 1593, 3937, 9551, <p>, ..., <p>\n    Extra hash: <image hash>\nBlock 1\n    Parent hash: Block 0 hash\n    Token IDs: <p>, ..., <p>\n    Extra hash: <image hash>\nBlock 2\n    Parent hash: Block 1 hash\n    Token IDs: <p>, ..., <p>\n    Extra hash: <image hash>\nBlock 3\n    Parent hash: Block 2 hash\n    Token IDs: <p>, ..., <p>, 4\n    Extra hash: <image hash>\n```",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E2a03563f48d167823f853c8e",
        "chunk_id": "127c3d21a1f01f70bb797f05",
        "parent_id": "3a5fe3bc81f750c9117c4584",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L17-L19",
        "content": "* Parent hash value: The hash value of the parent hash block.\n* Block tokens: A tuple of tokens in this block. The reason to include the exact tokens is to reduce potential hash value collision.\n* Extra hashes: Other values required to make this block unique, such as LoRA IDs, multi-modality input hashes (see the example below), and cache salts to isolate caches in multi-tenant environments.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E90b31537bae2c3648ca73c6e",
        "chunk_id": "06cc02a6f11ba81ce52bf68f",
        "parent_id": "23edcec3f8d01408e418d987",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L192-L192",
        "content": "In v0, when detecting block 3 is duplicated, we free block 3 and let Request 2 use block 1 instead, so its block table becomes `[0, 1]` in Time 1.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
